    <sys:String x:Key="Error.SetLayered">SetLayeredWindowAttributes failed (Win32 error {0}).</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Error.OriginalUnknown"> Existing layered attributes could not be read (Win32 error {0}); the target may use WPF per-pixel transparency.</sys:String>
